auxio_music_ui — standalone GPL-3.0 UI module for this application.

Visual design is inspired by the open-source music player Auxio
(https://github.com/OxygenCobalt/Auxio). This module does not contain
Auxio’s source code; it is an original Compose + Media3 implementation.

Bundled runtime libraries (e.g. AndroidX Media3, Compose) remain under
their respective licenses.
